              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabuye kwaba khona futhi impi eGati, lapho kwakukhona umuntu omude kakhulu, eneminwe eyisithupha esandleni ngasinye nezinzwani eziyisithupha onyaweni ngalunye, ingamashumi amabili nane ngenani; futhi naye wazalelwa umdondoshiya.",
          "type": "text",
